{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/000a64c9242d947d1b8eae56be9132a2.avif?t=1767530736\" width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/e46fb0d11e089f1d12ef11df4e681f9a.poster.avif?t=1767530736\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/e46fb0d11e089f1d12ef11df4e681f9a.webm?t=1767530736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Complete quests to unlock powerful heroes, each with a distinct playstyle and a loyal pet that fights alongside you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/53cd27b5af80e4a81a60abc5dfecb487.avif?t=1767530736\" width=800 height=149 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/2fb331ac8d2d9279ef252554e4477e2e.avif?t=1767530736\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Area Weapons:</strong> Slam the ground to unleash shockwaves and <strong>obliterate groups of foes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff9 Projectile Weapons:</strong> <strong>Snipe enemies</strong> from afar or <strong>unleash deadly volleys</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Sword &amp; Shield:</strong> A perfect balance of <strong>offense</strong> and <strong>defense</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Utility Weapons:</strong> <strong>AoE damage</strong>, <strong>enemy control</strong>, and <strong>buffs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Summoning Staff:</strong> <strong>Call forth creatures</strong> to fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2620\ufe0f Poison:</strong> Inflicts <strong>poison (DoT)</strong> on enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Projectile Spells:</strong> <strong>Direct</strong>, <strong>high-impact attacks</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Area Spells:</strong> <strong>Devastating bursts</strong> or <strong>sustained damage</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Utility Spells:</strong> <strong>Enhance abilities</strong>, <strong>heal</strong>, or <strong>manipulate enemies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcab Diverse passives and more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cycle through weapons, spells, passives, and gear \u2014 adapting to each wave\u2019s challenges.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/0b1710e59b053a95c09abaaa84b7d363.avif?t=1767530736\" width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/854ccffe235369caeb952b46f5fa5e87.poster.avif?t=1767530736\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/854ccffe235369caeb952b46f5fa5e87.webm?t=1767530736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run:</strong> Sprint for speed, damage reduction, and health regen\u2014but disable weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash:</strong> Instantly dodge attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend:</strong> Block incoming damage with a shield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/4928cae3b05fa780f26a7a2d56f5332d.avif?t=1767530736\" width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/b0f29f9197467fc658dbb442cb953178.poster.avif?t=1767530736\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428930/extras/b0f29f9197467fc658dbb442cb953178.webm?t=1767530736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Challenges:</strong> Earn powerful rewards by completing objectives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirate Slime:</strong> Snatches your gold\u2014hunt it down next wave!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-ups:</strong> drop randomly from enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop:</strong> Upgrade, sell, and refine your loadout.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love Slime Attack: Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Strate